                                        "entry_id": "3ddac87f-a9a4-3875-9328-ba18634148c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A box, usually made of metal, in which valuables can be locked for safekeeping."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f11852f1-5d22-4326-8547-7437d859a8b5",
                                                "sense_id": "d64dde4d-b8ae-382b-b643-a97a338b177a",
                                                "text": "The small-timers, as he put it, kept their currency in their homes, in safes, in false ceilings, under beds. When necessary, our tax people know where to look. The big-timers, however, use Swiss banks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6aaca130-bdd7-38ec-9dde-f4e627b404f7",
                                        "entry_id": "3ddac87f-a9a4-3875-9328-ba18634148c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A condom."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1d57cdc-0a3c-4025-88b5-6aa14e7662aa",
                                                "sense_id": "6aaca130-bdd7-38ec-9dde-f4e627b404f7",
                                                "text": "Condoms ARE available, on the underground market, at the outrageous price of ten dollars a piece! Now, I do not mind paying ten bucks for a good piece, as well as some peace of mind, but even the mere possession of these 'safes' is a disciplinary offense!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c88a5443-e193-4443-abad-8eb2dd7dfebe",
                                                "sense_id": "6aaca130-bdd7-38ec-9dde-f4e627b404f7",
                                                "text": "She'd better have an arsenal of Trojans in her purse just in case he wasn't carrying a safe in his back pocket."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "159eade4-5875-3a97-a2ad-e841eb768319",
                                        "entry_id": "3ddac87f-a9a4-3875-9328-ba18634148c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A ventilated or refrigerated chest or closet for securing provisions from noxious animals or insects."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fe2738c-603a-4984-83af-4f498a52d15f",
                                                "sense_id": "159eade4-5875-3a97-a2ad-e841eb768319",
                                                "text": "The other room was a kitchen, with an open fireplace, a safe, a dresser and a tin sink, with a tap from the tank outside."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "73c9343e-320f-37d2-982d-95613b952255",
                                        "entry_id": "3ddac87f-a9a4-3875-9328-ba18634148c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A safety bicycle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "safe",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76943893-e0c4-3c51-9fb2-297e4462a7f6",
                                        "entry_id": "a5b06375-42b2-31eb-b568-fbf66adf222d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make something safe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1c99bfe-830e-4991-b46e-37a6ded4bd10",
                                                "sense_id": "76943893-e0c4-3c51-9fb2-297e4462a7f6",
                                                "text": "“It just trails behind the pylon until I land, then Cramer removes it when he safes the rocket pods. No evidence of anything when I taxi back inside the compound.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "143dcee2-6070-465b-8300-ef8a9fd72526",
                                                "sense_id": "76943893-e0c4-3c51-9fb2-297e4462a7f6",
                                                "text": "One of the most important events after touchdown will be to safe the Dauntless, which will include purging the engines and shutting down the landing systems […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e0e55fce-cebe-4598-b2f7-5abc888918c3",
                        "source_entry_id": "16cd612f-f4fc-34be-83cc-228f008d3834",
                        "source_sense_id": "96854dc2-0f54-3d0f-a44f-25906281fd5d",
                        "source_sense_description": "besonders gesicherter, gepanzerter Schrank, in dem Geld und andere Wertgegenstände aufbewahrt werden",
                        "target_lang_word": "strongbox",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "strongbox",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "245cbe41-6ba6-366f-b129-f9c8a89be86c",
                                        "entry_id": "d6ff3a5e-f1fd-3433-9863-084a3a0bdd08",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sturdy box with a lock, for storing valuables."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67a492ee-cadf-4656-8f88-11437a394763",
                                                "sense_id": "245cbe41-6ba6-366f-b129-f9c8a89be86c",
                                                "text": "An inroad on the strongbox, or an erasure in the ledger, or a missummation in a fitted account, could hardly have surprised him more disagreeably."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bb439dcf-2c30-4eb2-90a2-6d4214c5a2c9",
                        "source_entry_id": "16cd612f-f4fc-34be-83cc-228f008d3834",
                        "source_sense_id": "96854dc2-0f54-3d0f-a44f-25906281fd5d",
                        "source_sense_description": "besonders gesicherter, gepanzerter Schrank, in dem Geld und andere Wertgegenstände aufbewahrt werden",
                        "target_lang_word": "coffre-fort",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "coffre-fort",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ca38c2b-f1ca-3179-a713-193a478852c7",
                                        "entry_id": "9c059314-c52a-3a99-83df-b151b98d3686",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Coffre de métal, généralement en forme d’armoire, destiné à serrer de l’argent et les objets précieux, et construit de telle façon qu’il soit à l’abri du feu et des voleurs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06d21559-bb33-49a0-a33b-cc35557b45dd",
                                                "sense_id": "4ca38c2b-f1ca-3179-a713-193a478852c7",
                                                "text": "Vous contentez-vous de protéger vos coffres-forts? Voulez-vous laisser à la merci des ennemis de l'humanité votre liberté, votre patrie, vos fortunes même?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfe6e31b-593f-43f0-a51c-301f0a5ee1f9",
                                                "sense_id": "4ca38c2b-f1ca-3179-a713-193a478852c7",
                                                "text": "Oui, nous nous avouons les ennemis de l'ordre, de cet ordre qui ne profite qu'à ceux qui, à force d’exploitation et de roueries, sont parvenus à empiler des millions dans leur coffre-fort."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "debdd5f7-80fa-47a3-bbe4-24a1ca3dc999",
                                                "sense_id": "4ca38c2b-f1ca-3179-a713-193a478852c7",
                                                "text": "Il connaît la science plus compliquée des serrures, qui se compose d’un coup de doigté avec un coup de muscle et qui nous livre les hommes comme des enfants et les coffres-forts comme des jouets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9a60c39-c363-41cd-ae80-196642796fef",
                                                "sense_id": "4ca38c2b-f1ca-3179-a713-193a478852c7",
                                                "text": "Le coffre-fort ne veut pas être brutalisé, violenté ; il faut user de douceur avec lui, le caresser longuement. Une pince-monseigneur, un chalumeau ? Allons donc. Un petit air de flûte. Le charme opère."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb43e4c6-107d-4566-ac5e-024753993e68",
                                                "sense_id": "4ca38c2b-f1ca-3179-a713-193a478852c7",
                                                "text": "Les uns se prennent à espérer, d'autres à redouter que le nouveau ministre du Commerce ne réalise quelqu'une de ces réformes sociales dont la seule perspective fait trembler les satisfaits se mirant dans leurs coffres-forts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
